asic Query","Basic Mutation","Suspense Query","Reference Files","Key Rules","Query Best Practices","Mutation Best Practices","Caching Best Practices","Performance","Ground Rules"],"name_hint":"apollo · client","description_zh":"指导 React 应用使用 Apollo Client 4.x，包括安装、GraphQL 查询和变更 hooks、缓存策略、响应式变量本地状态及错误性能排查。"},{"path":"skills/apollo-connectors/SKILL.md","name":"apollo-connectors","description":"Guide for integrating REST APIs into GraphQL supergraphs using Apollo Connectors with @source and @connect directives. Use this skill when the user: (1) mentions \"connectors\", \"Apollo Connectors\", or \"REST Connector\", (2) wants to integrate a REST API into GraphQL, (3) references @source or @connect directives, (4) works with files containing \"# Note to AI Friends: This is an Apollo Connectors schema\".","headings":["Apollo Connectors Schema Assistant","MCP Tools","Process","Step 1: Research","Step 2: Implement","Step 3: Validate (Compose)","Step 4: Execute","Step 5: Test","Schema Template","Note to AI Friends: This is an Apollo Connectors schema. You should use your connectors-spec MCP tool if you have it available before editing this file.","Reference Files","Key Rules","Selection Mapping","DO - Direct sub-selection for arrays","DO NOT - Unnecessary root $","DO - Direct field selection","Entities","Literal Values"],"name_hint":"apollo · connectors","description_zh":"使用 Apollo Connectors 的 @source 与 @connect 指令，将 REST API 集成至 GraphQL supergraph；用于连接器需求、指令使用及带 Apollo Connectors 模式标识的文件。"},{"path":"skills/apollo-federation/SKILL.md","name":"apollo-federation","description":"Guide for authoring Apollo Federation subgraph schemas. Use this skill when: (1) creating new subgraph schemas for a federated supergraph, (2) defining or modifying entities with @key, (3) sharing types/fields across subgraphs with @shareable, (4) working with federation directives (@external, @requires, @provides, @override, @inaccessible), (5) troubleshooting composition errors, (6) any task involving federation schema design patterns.","headings":["Apollo Federation Schema Authoring","Federation 2 Schema Setup","Core Directives Quick Reference","Reference Files","Key Patterns","Entity Definition","Entity Contributions Across Subgraphs","Products subgraph","Reviews subgraph","Computed Fields with @requires","Value Types with @shareable","Entity Stub (Reference Without Contributing)","Ground Rules"],"name_hint":"apollo · federation","description_zh":"编写 Apollo Federation 子图模式，包括新建子图、@key 实体、@shareable 共享类型字段、@external/@requires/@provides/@override/@inaccessible 指令、组合错误及联邦设计模式。"},{"path":"skills/apollo-ios/SKILL.md","name":"apollo-ios","description":"Guide for building Apple-platform applications with Apollo iOS, the strongly-typed GraphQL client for Swift. Use this skill when: (1) adding Apollo iOS to a Swift Package Manager or Xcode project, (2) configuring `apollo-codegen-config.json` and running code generation, (3) configuring an `ApolloClient` with auth, interceptors, and caching, (4) writing queries, mutations, or subscriptions from SwiftUI views, (5) writing tests against generated operation mocks.","headings":["Apollo iOS Guide","Untrusted content","Process","Reference Files","Scripts","Key Rules"],"name_hint":"apollo · ios","description_zh":"用 Apollo iOS 强类型 Swift GraphQL 客户端构建 Apple 平台应用，支持 SwiftPM/Xcode 添加、apollo-codegen-config.json 与代码生成、认证拦截器缓存、SwiftUI 查询变更订阅及基于操作 mock 的测试。"},{"path":"skills/apollo-kotlin/SKILL.md","name":"apollo-kotlin","description":"Guide for building applications with Apollo Kotlin, the GraphQL client library for Android and Kotlin. Use this skill when: (1) setting up Apollo Kotlin in a Gradle project for Android, Kotlin/JVM, or KMP, (2) configuring schema download and codegen for GraphQL services, (3) configuring an `ApolloClient` with auth, interceptors, and caching, (4) writing queries, mutations, or subscriptions,","headings":["Apollo Kotlin Guide","Process","Reference Files","Scripts","Key Rules"],"name_hint":"apollo · kotlin","description_zh":"指导 Android、Kotlin/JVM 或 KMP Gradle 项目接入 Apollo Kotlin GraphQL 客户端，包括下载模式、服务代码生成、认证拦截器缓存和查询、变更及订阅。"},{"path":"skills/apollo-mcp-server/SKILL.md","name":"apollo-mcp-server","description":"Guide for using Apollo MCP Server to connect AI agents with GraphQL APIs. Use this skill when: (1) setting up or configuring Apollo MCP Server, (2) defining MCP tools from GraphQL operations, (3) using introspection tools (introspect, search, validate, execute), (4) troubleshooting MCP server connectivity or tool execution issues.","headings":["Apollo MCP Server Guide","Quick Start","Step 1: Install","Linux / MacOS","Windows","Step 2: Configure","config.yaml","Step 3: Connect","Built-in Tools","Defining Custom Tools","1. Operation Files (Recommended)","operations/GetUser.graphql","operations/CreateUser.graphql","2. Operation Collections","3. Persisted Queries","Reference Files","Key Rules","Security"],"name_hint":"apollo · mcp · server","description_zh":"使用 Apollo MCP Server 连接 AI 智能体与 GraphQL API，涵盖安装配置、由 GraphQL 操作定义 MCP 工具、introspect/search/validate/execute 查询及连接或执行故障排查。"},{"path":"skills/apollo-router-plugin-creator/SKILL.md","name":"apollo-router-plugin-creator","description":"Guide for writing Apollo Router native Rust plugins. Use this skill when: (1) users want to create a new router plugin, (2) users want to add service hooks (router_service, supergraph_service, execution_service, subgraph_service), (3) users want to modify an existing router plugin, (4) users need to understand router plugin patterns or the request lifecycle. (5) triggers on requests like \"create a new plugin\", \"add a router plugin\", \"modify the X plugin\", or \"add subgraph_service hook\".","headings":["Apollo Router Plugin Creator","Request Lifecycle","Service Hooks","Service Overview","Individual Hooks (Tower Layers)","Choosing a Service Hook","Quick Start","Step 1: Create Plugin File","Step 2: Define Configuration Struct","Step 3: Define Plugin Struct","Step 4: Implement Plugin Trait","Step 5: Add Service Hooks","Step 6: Register Plugin","Step 7: Add Module to mod.rs","Step 8: Configure in YAML","Common Patterns","Examples","Apollo Router Examples"],"name_hint":"apollo · router · plugin · creator","description_zh":"编写或修改 Apollo Router 原生 Rust 插件，添加 router_service、supergraph_service、execution_service 或 subgraph_service 钩子，解释插件模式与请求生命周期。"},{"path":"skills/apollo-router/SKILL.md","name":"apollo-router","description":"Version-aware guide for configuring and running Apollo Router for federated GraphQL supergraphs. Generates correct YAML for both Router v1.x and v2.x. Use this skill when: (1) setting up Apollo Router to run a supergraph, (2) configuring routing, headers, or CORS, (3) implementing custom plugins (Rhai scripts or coprocessors), (4) configuring telemetry (tracing, metrics, logging), (5) troubleshooting Router performance or connectivity issues, (6) securing the graph with JWT, declarative field-level authorization directives, or persisted-query safelisting, (7) managing router.yaml as version-controlled config with CI/CD validation.","headings":["Apollo Router Config Generator","Step 1: Version Selection","Step 2: Environment Selection","Step 3: Feature Selection","Step 4: Gather Parameters","CORS","JWT Authentication","Declarative Authorization (field-level)","Persisted Query Safelisting (GraphOS PQL)","Connectors (v2 only)","Operation Limits","Telemetry","Traffic Shaping","Response Caching (v2 only, v2.6.0+)","Step 5: Generate Config","Step 6: Validate","Required Validation Gate (always run)","Configuration as Code (git + CI/CD)"],"name_hint":"apollo · router","description_zh":"按 Apollo Router v1.x/v2.x 版本生成 YAML 并运行联邦 GraphQL supergraph，配置路由、头、CORS、Rhai 或协处理器、遥测及性能连接排障；支持 JWT、声明式字段授权、持久查询许可列表和版本控制下 router.yaml 的 CI/CD 验证。"},{"path":"skills/apollo-server/SKILL.md","name":"apollo-server","description":"Guide for building GraphQL servers with Apollo Server 5.x. Use this skill when: (1) setting up a new Apollo Server project, (2) 