eadings":["GraphQL Schema Design Guide","Schema Design Principles","1. Design for Client Needs","2. Be Explicit","3. Design for Evolution","Quick Reference","Type Definition Syntax","Nullability Rules","Input vs Output Types","Output type - what clients receive","Input type - what clients send","Mutation using input type","Interface Pattern","Union Pattern","Reference Files","Key Rules","Type Design","Field Design"],"name_hint":"graphql · 结构","description_zh":"设计或审阅 GraphQL 模式，处理类型结构、可空性、分页、错误模式及模式安全。"},{"path":"skills/rover/SKILL.md","name":"rover","description":"Guide for using Apollo Rover CLI to manage GraphQL schemas and federation. Use this skill when: (1) publishing or fetching subgraph/graph schemas, (2) composing supergraph schemas locally or via GraphOS, (3) running local supergraph development with rover dev, (4) validating schemas with check and lint commands, (5) configuring Rover authentication and environment, (6) exploring or searching a graph's schema for agent-driven discovery (rover schema describe / rover schema search).","headings":["Apollo Rover CLI Guide","Quick Start","Step 1: Install","macOS/Linux","npm (cross-platform)","Windows PowerShell","Step 2: Authenticate","Interactive authentication (opens browser)","Or set environment variable","Step 3: Verify Installation","Explore a Graph's Schema (start here for schema questions)","What can I query? (compact overview)","Find a field by concept/keyword (returns the path from a root operation)","Zoom into one type or field","Core Commands Overview","Graph Reference Format","Subgraph Workflow","Publishing a Subgraph"],"name_hint":"rover","description_zh":"使用 Apollo Rover CLI 管理 GraphQL 模式与联邦，发布获取子图或图模式、本地或 GraphOS 组合、rover dev 开发、check/lint 验证、认证环境及 describe/search 的智能体模式发现。"},{"path":"skills/rust-best-practices/SKILL.md","name":"rust-best-practices","description":"Guide for writing idiomatic Rust code based on Apollo GraphQL's best practices handbook. Use this skill when: (1) writing new Rust code